  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5 y equals 10 x plus 11\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>10</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>11</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"minus 5 y equals 5 x minus 21\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"30 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>30</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
